{"id":"9ad49daf03d3d3f1e24a85c57ad40321749cb23e","axis":"silent","repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go","sha":"9ad49daf03d3d3f1e24a85c57ad40321749cb23e","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -143,6 +143,10 @@ See our [versioning policy](VERSIONING.md) for more information about these stab"," - ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Let an `http` or `https` scheme in `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` or the signal-specific endpoint environment variable take precedence over `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_INSECURE` and the signal-specific insecure environment variable in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#9273)","   Previously, `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_INSECURE=true` made these exporters send plaintext to an `https://` endpoint."," - Preserve `ScopeMetrics` slice capacity in `PeriodicReader`'s `sync.Pool` by resetting slice length instead of overwriting the struct, avoiding per-cycle heap allocations in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#8535)","+- Reject negative and overflowing `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TIMEOUT` and `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TRACES_TIMEOUT` values in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc` and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#9338)","+  Previously, such a value produced a negative timeout that removed the export deadline.","+- Reject negative and overflowing `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TIMEOUT` and `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_METRICS_TIMEOUT` values in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc` and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#9338)","+  Previously, such a value produced a negative timeout that removed the export deadline."," "," ### Removed"," "],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc/internal/envconfig/envconfig.go","lines":["@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@ import ("," \t\"crypto/x509\""," \t\"errors\""," \t\"fmt\"","+\t\"math\""," \t\"net/url\""," \t\"strconv\""," \t\"strings\"","@@ -70,11 +71,19 @@ func WithBool(n string, fn func(bool)) ConfigFn {"," func WithDuration(n string, fn func(time.Duration)) func(e *EnvOptionsReader) {"," \treturn func(e *EnvOptionsReader) {"," \t\tif v, ok := e.GetEnvValue(n); ok {","-\t\t\td, err := strconv.Atoi(v)","+\t\t\td, err := strconv.ParseInt(v, 10, 64)"," \t\t\tif err != nil {"," \t\t\t\tglobal.Error(err, \"parse duration\", \"input\", v)"," \t\t\t\treturn"," \t\t\t}","+\t\t\tif d < 0 {","+\t\t\t\tglobal.Error(errors.New(\"negative duration\"), \"parse duration\", \"input\", v)","+\t\t\t\treturn","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\tif d > math.MaxInt64/int64(time.Millisecond) {","+\t\t\t\tglobal.Error(errors.New(\"duration overflows time.Duration\"), \"parse duration\", \"input\", v)","+\t\t\t\treturn","+\t\t\t}"," \t\t\tfn(time.Duration(d) * time.Millisecond)"," \t\t}"," \t}"],"additions":10,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc/internal/envconfig/envconfig_test.go","lines":["@@ -226,6 +226,99 @@ func TestEnvConfig(t *testing.T) {"," \t\t\t},"," \t\t\texpectedOptions: []testOption{},"," \t\t},","+\t\t{","+\t\t\tname: \"with a zero duration config\",","+\t\t\treader: EnvOptionsReader{","+\t\t\t\tGetEnv: func(n string) string {","+\t\t\t\t\tif n == \"HELLO\" {","+\t\t\t\t\t\treturn \"0\"","+\t\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\t\treturn \"\"","+\t\t\t\t},","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tconfigs: []ConfigFn{","+\t\t\t\tWithDuration(\"HELLO\", func(v time.Duration) {","+\t\t\t\t\toptions = append(options, testOption{TestDuration: v})","+\t\t\t\t}),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\texpectedOptions: []testOption{","+\t\t\t\t{","+\t\t\t\t\tTestDuration: 0,","+\t\t\t\t},","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t},","+\t\t{","+\t\t\tname: \"with a negative duration config\",","+\t\t\treader: EnvOptionsReader{","+\t\t\t\tGetEnv: func(n str